menu "PWM: Pulse-Width Modulation"

# ==================================
# PWM
# ==================================
config MR_USE_DRIVER_PWM
    depends on MR_USE_DRIVER
    bool "Use PWM"
    default n
    help
        Enable the pulse-width modulation driver framework.
        Features:
            - Controller timing and per-channel output configuration
            - Atomic multi-channel updates
            - Complementary outputs and dead time
            - Fault inputs and controller-level hardware signals
        The PCA9685 HardTree backend requires I2C and supports continuous,
        edge-aligned PWM with immediate updates, without advanced signals.

endmenu
